{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRETCH THE WORLD! In this comedic first-person puzzle adventure, you are The Stretchmancer. Squash and stretch everything around you to solve fiendish puzzles, defeat the Claustro Empire, and save the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/c4fc2ce9491c56aec853deb1a20ed182.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/c4fc2ce9491c56aec853deb1a20ed182.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRETCH!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>The Stretchmancer - </strong>a strong and conveniently silent hero with access to the power of The Stretch. Using this ability, you can STRETCH and SQUISH the environment like it\u2019s everything-is-made-of-rubber-day at the accordion factory!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/f53040e3d3327f4bba630629d373bb0a.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/f53040e3d3327f4bba630629d373bb0a.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/f53040e3d3327f4bba630629d373bb0a.mp4?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/2dda38cfa98cc527859657b5a8803b12.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/2dda38cfa98cc527859657b5a8803b12.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A crew missing some screws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet a bunch of weird and silly characters on your journey - some friends, some foes, some who haven\u2019t quite made up their minds yet. Like your nervous turtle-pal Walt, your no-nonsense rival Casey, and the fearsome (according to him) Sgt Squish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/bdfe7709e650b3c32cec3cb3aa3e3fbf.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/bdfe7709e650b3c32cec3cb3aa3e3fbf.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/bdfe7709e650b3c32cec3cb3aa3e3fbf.mp4?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/9d5f6d67e8d1f035db0ecca9c6340133.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/9d5f6d67e8d1f035db0ecca9c6340133.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No two rooms are the same!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore and solve puzzles, you\u2019ll encounter dozens of unique obstacles that\u2019ll keep you on your toes - from bounce-fueled goo to exploding headbands and even Armadillo Bill's Rollticulated Rollerbombs\u2122.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/4078dba91695dc5a0af24e4848047c6d.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/4078dba91695dc5a0af24e4848047c6d.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/4078dba91695dc5a0af24e4848047c6d.mp4?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Old-school adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, grin, and shake your head at an absurd and fully voice-acted story inspired by 90\u2019s Saturday morning cartoon vibes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stretch EVERYTHING!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve brain-bending puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple biomes full of unique and absurd obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with hidden collectibles, extra challenges, and SECRETS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More cool features we can\u2019t reveal yet!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2929290?t=1773242564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773242564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/1ab312861df3066c4d7edfdc9aacf47900d9ca00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773242564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/1ab312861df3066c4d7edfdc9aacf47900d9ca00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773242564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRETCH THE WORLD! In this comedic first-person puzzle adventure, you are The Stretchmancer. Squash and stretch everything around you to solve fiendish puzzles, defeat the Claustro Empire, and save the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/c4fc2ce9491c56aec853deb1a20ed182.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/c4fc2ce9491c56aec853deb1a20ed182.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRETCH!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>The Stretchmancer - </strong>a strong and conveniently silent hero with access to the power of The Stretch. Using this ability, you can STRETCH and SQUISH the environment like it\u2019s everything-is-made-of-rubber-day at the accordion factory!<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/f53040e3d3327f4bba630629d373bb0a.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/f53040e3d3327f4bba630629d373bb0a.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/f53040e3d3327f4bba630629d373bb0a.mp4?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/2dda38cfa98cc527859657b5a8803b12.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/2dda38cfa98cc527859657b5a8803b12.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A crew missing some screws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet a bunch of weird and silly characters on your journey - some friends, some foes, some who haven\u2019t quite made up their minds yet. Like your nervous turtle-pal Walt, your no-nonsense rival Casey, and the fearsome (according to him) Sgt Squish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/bdfe7709e650b3c32cec3cb3aa3e3fbf.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/bdfe7709e650b3c32cec3cb3aa3e3fbf.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/bdfe7709e650b3c32cec3cb3aa3e3fbf.mp4?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/9d5f6d67e8d1f035db0ecca9c6340133.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/9d5f6d67e8d1f035db0ecca9c6340133.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No two rooms are the same!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore and solve puzzles, you\u2019ll encounter dozens of unique obstacles that\u2019ll keep you on your toes - from bounce-fueled goo to exploding headbands and even Armadillo Bill's Rollticulated Rollerbombs\u2122.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/4078dba91695dc5a0af24e4848047c6d.poster.avif?t=1773242564\" width=1170 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/4078dba91695dc5a0af24e4848047c6d.webm?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/extras/4078dba91695dc5a0af24e4848047c6d.mp4?t=1773242564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Old-school adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, grin, and shake your head at an absurd and fully voice-acted story inspired by 90\u2019s Saturday morning cartoon vibes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stretch EVERYTHING!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve brain-bending puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple biomes full of unique and absurd obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with hidden collectibles, extra challenges, and SECRETS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More cool features we can\u2019t reveal yet!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Triangle Wave"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2929290/e6723eaaa1309acb52afd4b2d64815eb3196faed/header.jpg?t=1773242564","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual-Core 2.4 GHz / Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 6000 or equivalent; Radeon HD 6750M (512 VRAM) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 (4 * 3200)  / Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon R9 M390 (2048 VRAM) equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2929290/547338810/228147dbbcfa5209e03c8daa33af5dee871a8ed2/1765392364/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765393312","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2929290/547338810/228147dbbcfa5209e03c8daa33af5dee871a8ed2/1765392364/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765393312","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2929290/547338810/228147dbbcfa5209e03c8daa33af5dee871a8ed2/1765392364/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765393312","id":257246817,"name":"Stretchmancer Publisher Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a